[{"_1":2},"routes/post",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8,"_9":-5,"_10":-5,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"post",{"_30":42,"_32":43,"_65":79,"_80":81,"_57":58,"_82":61},"chars",1916,"updated","thumbnail","excerpt","java의 if문에는 boolean 또는 Boolean 타입으로 평가되는 표현식이 있어야 하며, 해당 표현식이 true 이면 중괄호 {} 안의 코드를 실행한다. 이전에 다루었던 Swift와는 반대로, java에서…","html","<h2 id=\"if문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#if문\">if문</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>java의 if문에는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>boolean</span></span></code></span> 또는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Boolean</span></span></code></span> 타입으로 평가되는 표현식이 있어야 하며, 해당 표현식이 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>true</span></span></code></span> 이면 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>중괄호 {}</span></span></code></span> 안의 코드를 실행한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>이전에 다루었던 Swift와는 반대로, java에서 if문의 표현식(Expression)에는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>소괄호()</span></span></code></span>가 필수이다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>표현식(Expression)\n<ul>\n<li>값을 만들어내는 코드</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>문장(Statement)\n<ul>\n<li>어떤 동작을 수행하는 실행 단위</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Expression) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Expression이 true인 경우 실행할 코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>또한 if문 다음에 실행할 명령이 하나인 경우, <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>중괄호 { }</span></span></code></span>를 생략할 수 있다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>하지만 권장되지 않는다.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>가독성</strong>과 <strong>유지보수성</strong>을 높이기 위해 중괄호를 사용하는 것이 좋다.</li>\n<li>예2의 경우, 두번째 줄의 코드는 if문과 관계가 없다.\n<ul>\n<li>조건이 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>true</span></span></code></span>이던 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>false</span></span></code></span>이던, 두번째 코드는 실행될 것이다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 예1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"예시 코드입니다.\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 예2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"예시 코드입니다.\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"if 문과 무관한 코드입니다.\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"switch문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#switch문\">Switch문</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>if 문은 비교 연산자를 사용할 수 있지만, switch문은 단순히 값이 같은지만 비교한다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>switch</span></span></code></span> 키워드 후에 오는 선택자 표현식(selector expression)이 어떤 값과 매치될 때 실행할 코드를 작성할 수 있다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>break</span></span></code></span>는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>case</span></span></code></span> 내에서 실행중인 코드를 끝내고, switch문을 빠져나가게 하는 역할을 한다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>break</span></span></code></span>가 없다면, 일치하는 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>case</span></span></code></span> 이후 모든 case의 코드들이 순서대로 실행된다.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>default</span></span></code></span>는 선택자 표현식과 일치하는 case가 없는 경우 실행된다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>if문으로 따지면 else와 같다.</li>\n<li>필수가 아니며 선택이다.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">switch</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (선택자 표현식) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 선택자 표현식의 값이 value1일 때 실행되는 코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">default:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 표현식과 일치하는 case가 없는 경우 실행되는 코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ...</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 예</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">switch</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"값 일치: 0\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// break가 없다면 아래 case 1 실행 후 break를 만나 switch문이 종료 될 것이다.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        System.out.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"값 일치: 1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></spa